lg:AT-MEDIENG-s25-1-q1-en
    a lgo:Translation ;
    lgo:reviewStatus lgv:Draft ;
    lgo:sourceTextSha256 "c676391f66e4f194d452683b9d132d1bd0454286bc8a55afe7425ba0b54ca45d" ;
    lgo:text "(1) The media owner of every periodical medium shall publish the information specified in paragraphs 2 to 4. For periodical media works, the imprint shall also state the web address at which this information can be found easily, directly and permanently, or the information shall be appended to each issue of the medium. For broadcasting programmes, all this information shall either be made permanently available on an easily found teletext page or be published in the Official Gazette of the \"Wiener Zeitung\" within one month of the start of broadcasting and in the first month of each calendar year. On a website, this information shall be made available so that it can be found easily, directly and permanently. For recurring electronic media, either the web address at which this information can be found easily, directly and permanently shall be stated, or the information shall be appended to each issue of the medium. Where the media owner is a service provider within the meaning of § 3 no. 2 ECG, BGBl. I No. 152/2001, the disclosure may be made available together with the information under § 5 ECG."@en ;
    lgo:translatedBy "claude-opus-5-5" ;
    lgo:translatedOn "2026-11-11"^^xsd:date ;
    lgo:translationMethod lgv:MachineTranslation ;
    lgo:translationOf lg:AT-MEDIENG-s25-1-q1 .

lg:AT-MEDIENG-s25-2-q1-en
    a lgo:Translation ;
    lgo:reviewStatus lgv:Draft ;
    lgo:sourceTextSha256 "ded360f2b85900ad9d1bf75f786ff69f9fdbbf4e0f66fe617e10e012296c1ea4" ;
    lgo:text "(2) The following shall be stated: the media owner with name or company name, business purpose, place of residence or seat (establishment), and the names of the media owner's representative bodies and, where there is a supervisory board, its members. In addition, for all persons holding a direct or indirect interest in a media owner, their respective ownership, participation, share and voting-right holdings shall be stated. Any silent partnerships in the media owner and in the persons holding a direct or indirect interest in it within the meaning of the preceding sentence shall also be stated, and trust relationships shall be disclosed at every level. Where foundations hold a direct or indirect interest, the founder and the respective beneficiaries of the foundation shall also be disclosed. Where the media owner is an association, or an association holds a direct or indirect interest in the media owner, the association's board and purpose shall be stated. Persons holding a direct or indirect interest, trustors, founders and beneficiaries of a foundation are obliged, at the request of the media owner, to provide it with the information it needs to fulfil its disclosure obligation."@en ;
    lgo:translatedBy "claude-opus-5-5" ;
    lgo:translatedOn "2026-11-11"^^xsd:date ;
    lgo:translationMethod lgv:MachineTranslation ;
    lgo:translationOf lg:AT-MEDIENG-s25-2-q1 .

lg:AT-MEDIENG-s25-4-q1-en
    a lgo:Translation ;
    lgo:reviewStatus lgv:Draft ;
    lgo:sourceTextSha256 "228eecbdc55165239c343351dd7dd0b3176478299b61ea60b08988886f740035" ;
    lgo:text "(4) A statement on the basic direction of a periodical print work (editorial line) or of any other periodical medium shall also be published. Within the meaning of § 2, changes and additions to the basic direction take effect only once they have been published."@en ;
    lgo:translatedBy "claude-opus-5-5" ;
    lgo:translatedOn "2026-11-11"^^xsd:date ;
    lgo:translationMethod lgv:MachineTranslation ;
    lgo:translationOf lg:AT-MEDIENG-s25-4-q1 .

lg:AT-MEDIENG-s25-5-q1-en
    a lgo:Translation ;
    lgo:reviewStatus lgv:Draft ;
    lgo:sourceTextSha256 "a5d616fb4d9b47ab5d49c78aa28142c3b0cac43c3bca17b50c1ff219dc91b136" ;
    lgo:text "(5) For a medium within the meaning of § 1(1) no. 5a(b) and (c) whose information content does not go beyond presenting the media owner's personal life or presenting the media owner, and is not capable of influencing public opinion, only the name or company name, where applicable the business purpose, and the place of residence or seat of the media owner shall be stated. Paragraphs 3 and 4 do not apply to such media."@en ;
    lgo:translatedBy "claude-opus-5-5" ;
    lgo:translatedOn "2026-11-11"^^xsd:date ;
    lgo:translationMethod lgv:MachineTranslation ;
    lgo:translationOf lg:AT-MEDIENG-s25-5-q1 .

lg:AT-MEDIENG-title-9fae080ed736-en
    a lgo:Translation ;
    lgo:reviewStatus lgv:Draft ;
    lgo:sourceTextSha256 "9fae080ed7363236b6a9c889dda3f436ec91c3e469d5cef69eb8d4959d7a492c" ;
    lgo:text "Federal Act of 12 June 1981 on the Press and Other Journalistic Media (Media Act – MedienG)"@en ;
    lgo:translatedBy "claude-opus-5-5" ;
    lgo:translatedOn "2026-11-11"^^xsd:date ;
    lgo:translatedProperty eli:title ;
    lgo:translationMethod lgv:MachineTranslation ;
    lgo:translationOf lg:AT-MEDIENG .

lg:AT-TKG-2021-s165-3-q1-en
    a lgo:Translation ;
    lgo:reviewStatus lgv:Draft ;
    lgo:sourceTextSha256 "01c2b129dabd4f9c135e3f518266cd84da164d60c146f95efc4bd39a5f2625e6" ;
    lgo:text "(3) Operators of public communications services and providers of an information-society service within the meaning of § 3 Z 1 of the E-Commerce Act, BGBl. I No. 152/2001, are required to inform the user which personal data they will process, on which legal basis and for which purposes this is done and for how long the data will be stored. The collection of this data is only permissible if the user has actively consented to it on the basis of clear and comprehensive information. This does not prevent technical storage or access where its sole purpose is to carry out the transmission of a message over a communications network or, where strictly necessary, so that the provider of an information-society service expressly requested by the user can provide that service. The user must also be informed of the possible uses arising from the search functions embedded in the electronic versions of the directories. This information must be given in an appropriate form, in particular in the framework of general terms and conditions and no later than at the start of the legal relationship."@en ;
    lgo:translatedBy "SWE-2" ;
    lgo:translatedOn "2026-11-02"^^xsd:date ;
    lgo:translationMethod lgv:MachineTranslation ;
    lgo:translationOf lg:AT-TKG-2021-s165-3-q1 .

lg:AT-UGB-s14-1-q1-en
    a lgo:Translation ;
    lgo:reviewStatus lgv:Draft ;
    lgo:sourceTextSha256 "52a8883244c74c9da587f794e743446defe92c52f4557e15086eec36071597e0" ;
    lgo:text "(1) Entrepreneurs registered in the companies register (Firmenbuch) must state, on all business letters and order forms, whether on paper or otherwise addressed to a specific recipient, as well as on their websites, the company's name, its legal form, its seat and its companies-register number, where applicable a note that the entrepreneur is in liquidation, and the companies-register court. In the case of a general partnership or limited partnership in which no partner with unlimited liability is a natural person, those particulars must also be given on the partnership's business letters, order forms and websites for the partners with unlimited liability. Sole proprietors must also state their name where it differs from the company name."@en ;
    lgo:translatedBy "SWE-2" ;
    lgo:translatedOn "2026-11-02"^^xsd:date ;
    lgo:translationMethod lgv:MachineTranslation ;
    lgo:translationOf lg:AT-UGB-s14-1-q1 .

lg:AT-UGB-s14-2-q1-en
    a lgo:Translation ;
    lgo:reviewStatus lgv:Draft ;
    lgo:sourceTextSha256 "7dc3933949ab1eec8be51f7a960cbc4256fb531199913d0ca6d8d004979eed4b" ;
    lgo:text "(2) Where a corporation states its capital on business letters, order forms and websites, the share capital (Grund- und Stammkapital) must always be given and, in the case of a joint-stock company where the issue price of the shares has not been fully paid, or a limited-liability company where not all cash contributions have been paid in, the total amount of the outstanding contributions."@en ;
    lgo:translatedBy "SWE-2" ;
    lgo:translatedOn "2026-11-02"^^xsd:date ;
    lgo:translationMethod lgv:MachineTranslation ;
    lgo:translationOf lg:AT-UGB-s14-2-q1 .

lg:AT-UGB-s14-3-q1-en
    a lgo:Translation ;
    lgo:reviewStatus lgv:Draft ;
    lgo:sourceTextSha256 "2b7b07cddd315fe46d8e0d7ecf917d5ca07ec199f7a353f0e1cda665da4347e1" ;
    lgo:text "(3) On business letters, order forms and websites used by a domestic branch of an entrepreneur whose principal establishment or seat is abroad, the company name, the branch's companies-register number and the companies-register court must also be stated, in addition to the particulars under paragraphs 1 and 2."@en ;
